d (Rosewood Garden Estate) and 'View Profile' on a vendor card (Eternal Moments Photography); no modal, dialog, or navigation occurred in either case - the page remained on the same listing with no additional details shown, and no console errors were logged.\", \"evidence\": null}, {\"item_id\": \"IX-13\", \"verdict\": \"PASS\", \"issue\": null, \"actual\": null, \"evidence\": \"Marked task -> checklist progress 17% immediately; unmarked -> 0%; marked 2 tasks -> 33%; dashboard aggregate progress matched checklist progress (17% when 1/6 done). After page reload, checklist still shows 33% (2/6 completed), confirming persistence.\"}, {\"item_id\": \"IX-14\", \"verdict\": \"PASS\", \"issue\": null, \"actual\": null, \"evidence\": \"All search/filter interactions (toggles, typing) updated result count and grid immediately with no submit button ever clicked. Clearing search field restored 10/10 vendors and 8/8 venues; Clear all filters button restored full lists after combined filters.\"}, {\"item_id\": \"IX-19\", \"verdict\": \"FAIL\", \"issue\": \"Cancelled draft persists in edit form instead of resetting to saved values\", \"actual\": \"After editing partnerOne to 'ShouldNotSave' and budget to '99999' then clicking Cancel, dashboard correctly still showed Alex & Jordan/$30,000. But reopening the editor again showed the cancelled draft values (partnerOne='ShouldNotSave', budget='99999') instead of the last saved values (Alex, 30000).\", \"evidence\": null}, {\"item_id\": \"CT-15\", \"verdict\": \"PASS\", \"issue\": null, \"actual\": null, \"evidence\": \"Dashboard shows couple names (Alexander & Jordana), formatted date (Jan 1, 2028), budget ($45,000), guests (200), planning progress (17%), favorite previews/counts (1 saved venue: Rosewood Garden Estate; 1 saved vendor: Eternal Moments Photography), and saved-checklist count/preview (1 saved: 12+ Months Before, 1 of 6 completed).\"}, {\"item_id\": \"CT-16\", \"verdict\": \"PASS\", \"issue\": null, \"actual\": null, \"evidence\": \"Venue cards show name, location, type, price range, rating, description, and capacity (e.g. Rosewood Garden Estate: Napa Valley CA, Garden, Luxury $$$, 4.9, description, Up to 200 guests). Vendor cards show name, location, service type, price range, rating, description, and specialties (e.g. Eternal Moments Photography: Los Angeles CA, Photography, Luxury $$$, 4.9, description, Candid Shots/Drone Photography/Same-Day Edits).\"}, {\"item_id\": \"CT-17\", \"verdict\": \"PASS\", \"issue\": null, \"actual\": null, \"evidence\": \"Categories present: Planning (2 checklists: 12+ Months Before, 8-10 Months Before), Ceremony (Ceremony Planning), Reception (Reception Details), Attire (Wedding Attire), Honeymoon (Honeymoon Planning) - one checklist each minimum. Expanded checklist shows every task with title + description text.\"}, {\"item_id\": \"CT-18\", \"verdict\": \"PASS\", \"issue\": null, \"actual\": null, \"evidence\": \"Combined filters (Garden+Luxury venue -> 1 exact match; Florist+Budget vendor -> 1 exact match) all satisfied both criteria. Search 'zzzznotfound'+Photography filter -> 'Showing 0 of 10 vendors' with explicit 'No vendors match your search.' message. Clear all filters restored 10/10.\"}]}"
